#: scenario8:scenario8_D1B494DA_31AD_409F_91EE_C3F61A2683A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: deba7364aa4a1069ff82fba7fa61ab05a71393948d604e8c1379fced4c5b80f1
#. default-sha256: 721e5be53c6c3a1c0a2547ea6eb5c3046bdcedb42dd9c0f512dbe27b47188baa
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D1B494DA_31AD_409F_91EE_C3F61A2683A9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫On days when it was nice out,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I would take walks around the house’s grounds,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫晴れた日には実家の庭を散歩して――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A9BABB81_749F_4964_9AD1_E69F58DEE34D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: af52bf0be10b18936c3c45e97dedaf3cefafca412817c2aedf1244232ebe3433
#. default-sha256: 45c6389b2b72e6be53807aaf82bd654e59d143d7132918cdb18bd8707aef5d70
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A9BABB81_749F_4964_9AD1_E69F58DEE34D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫sometimes napping beneath a tree."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫僕は木陰でうたた寝をする……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4BED022D_815C_4FFF_B1B1_70419C5FC109
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b8d60c4b0d3e85dc139be355dea78d420708a3d535085484a99d81948d45c97
#. default-sha256: fd2c19b0b59113516f30d916b35930002618fbaea712f91e70e3187d696c4b49
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4BED022D_815C_4FFF_B1B1_70419C5FC109"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫whereas mine is flat and dull."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫僕のとは別物に見えた。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E3166BAA_BA5A_4E7B_9D32_689B25DD9633
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 760abce41797889f52e43ce81d239f31913cdc5459a68af48706ba7c26cd8de5
#. default-sha256: 9655457b18a1b57ef3277113ebec8274087cab0cbe5ab40ec17e7b2b8f9176dd
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E3166BAA_BA5A_4E7B_9D32_689B25DD9633"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You shone like a tiny little dancing sun."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫まるで太陽みたいだったよ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0114CDC6_DD89_463C_AF9E_DD612D17C3A0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9bc2a4a08a45ab03ab3c73b278c00a6adc01f48cd767c67bbbdca4c18fb13b51
#. default-sha256: 4db395f83ef676bfd43fffcf2c0be93ee3c7e7120a61760b64393c1ceec38ce6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0114CDC6_DD89_463C_AF9E_DD612D17C3A0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫At the time, I assumed that was how life would always be."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫そういう穏やかな毎日がさ……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_026D5E20_738D_4C2B_A483_A709FFB94996
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f4f2353f4a301503fbc9da10855175b24f55d87b3c8235ac0f8842bc6e4ac59
#. default-sha256: f88e2bff2fcc71e67a78d4d862dd462afb73748f8bb3124d6e8c91c9eb179bb3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_026D5E20_738D_4C2B_A483_A709FFB94996"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Part of me wanted to know why nobody bothered talking to me,⟪k:1⟫and part of me was "
"relieved. ⟪k:2⟫Somewhere inside, I knew I didn’t have what it took."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫でも、⟪k:1⟫心の中ではほっとしていたところもあったんだ。⟪k:2⟫僕は自覚していたんだよ。⟪k:3⟫僕は"
"跡取りの器じゃないって……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0C1CDE28_7606_473D_B23B_F7FB5A3A1B49
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6fd45e0ca06463405b70541c88367038fba7fc2ead25bde7af71c0d2dc783262
#. default-sha256: da614d50a3babdc2fc5ce84ff3c16bd2ff354d265416a15198397fab55bbf409
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0C1CDE28_7606_473D_B23B_F7FB5A3A1B49"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and in response, he formally disowned me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そう、⟪k:1⟫つまり僕は――勘当を言い渡されたんだ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_70CAA6B3_33FB_4FAC_ACFC_5AAD1525E679
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 227db3333c498165f680383db3c4fa9a8a6d4bb5bdf5d8a98446f0cd9d8fa763
#. default-sha256: b315358d1deddbb42d973fceec47613f694a72d7d728eff13faa75d0088eeede
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_70CAA6B3_33FB_4FAC_ACFC_5AAD1525E679"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You’re not the only one who still had some growing up to do, Nellie...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wasn’t "
"quite the adult I’d thought I was either."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫大人になっていなかったのは……、⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ネリー、⟪k:3⟫君だけじゃなく……僕もだった。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_FA7D6747_967F_4BD1_8158_BB4648567C75
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c4938ca8bb19c19f09611d2af7636f681ba1c810a8074a3be46f4bc7c36fa5e
#. default-sha256: 4d0d5a22b1681c7d1321452e187bdbbc6749812979c958e24d844e39c1613fea
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_FA7D6747_967F_4BD1_8158_BB4648567C75"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Fortunately—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫if you want to call it fortune—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I was given enough "
"money to live on for a decent length of time, as well as a place to stay."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫勘当を言い渡されたものの、⟪k:3⟫不幸中の幸いというべきか、⟪k:4⟫僕には暫く暮らせるだ"
"けの資金が渡された。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_2ACB9DF5_AC71_4539_99AC_FB660B3619B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 45e93dbcfb818300dcb7db1170f5b95befc8db0e8d33fc3482b24adba78c43c2
#. default-sha256: b7730f110b88ae4a1abcd8827f56c180c5c46a35c17edb9f9305f1335920f326
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2ACB9DF5_AC71_4539_99AC_FB660B3619B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫それから、⟪k:1⟫僕が暮らす場所もね……。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫実家からは程遠い場所に、⟪k:4⟫一軒家が用意され"
"たんだ。"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それから、⟪k:1⟫僕が暮らす場所もね……。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫実家からは程遠い場所に、⟪k:4⟫一軒家が用意され"
"たんだ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_82CD33D1_0CF8_440F_B31F_CA3D47AD9315
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4485348078804383ce756d8dca1523f32ed831ff1519dec349915e45e8341a36
#. default-sha256: 151b23186e8082b3c329fbbff93aa7932e9b437670b747359199f3b11d79c8b5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_82CD33D1_0CF8_440F_B31F_CA3D47AD9315"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...Oh?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫え………？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F0F66272_1A70_4843_A7E7_E74FE97787A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ec2a79ef78eb10cd0466b166c0f09b92c298a70d8dc01b194817709ee31acde
#. default-sha256: f1588eeeb29340d20e5dc9f5c79a92270b79e2dc3be2eda9fa4977a29b708330
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F0F66272_1A70_4843_A7E7_E74FE97787A7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I don’t need composers to come and write me songs for my birthday. ⟪k:2⟫As long as I "
"have the one thing that matters most to me, I can do without anything else."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫お誕生日に、⟪k:2⟫音楽家の人が曲をプレゼントしてくれなくたって――何より大切なものが傍にあ"
"れば、⟪k:3⟫それでいいんだから。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4CAD8A9E_DEF1_4D17_9955_4D40055BA4EB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b345002976a6f98f6b9257f5c8ec570a48ac07cf5ea464561eb04d55190a7729
#. default-sha256: 3afc44147f917dcffa6bf3863d07de5962656c2656c2f7d22eb0b8f9a0a8d1d7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4CAD8A9E_DEF1_4D17_9955_4D40055BA4EB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We may not have a huge yard, but the sun shines everywhere.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Flowers can grow even "
"without a gardener tending to them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫お庭がなくたって、⟪k:1⟫太陽はいつだって輝いているじゃない。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫庭師の人が手入れをしてな"
"くたって、⟪k:4⟫お花も咲くわ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0781453F_274D_4AFD_AE30_1C99F1552F2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d261101eebb8a5c224b8b11b96ac453941c478eccf14b3a46805802fc0d952dd
#. default-sha256: a8909f83a668fbb4ced335f2fee48b994ee4e2784a6f4e0ee8f580bcbe86a8d2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0781453F_274D_4AFD_AE30_1C99F1552F2F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What else sounds good? ⟪k:1⟫Hmm... ⟪k:2⟫I’m craving cookies!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫他には何が必要かしら？　⟪k:1⟫うーんと甘いクッキーも作りたいわ！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_16735FB1_6A43_4AAC_A996_D588EFCC1B56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f3a9d8b86ee2ad140f33f25d1631d2d297b59e787ecca5da682cb3deaec80ed
#. default-sha256: 19b708b3278e55b9f30a97499e25d11880e5d518ebc4d6869d688bc00e4c4332
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_16735FB1_6A43_4AAC_A996_D588EFCC1B56"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That’s the first smile I’ve seen since we got here."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫お兄さま、⟪k:2⟫やっと笑ったわ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_7A6088F2_2857_4496_9125_BCEA0EA68271
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86eb882d94fec82078eb2808ca5c1f138bf669604367dd4f31ec2caada042ebc
#. default-sha256: bb7d2de5ed72aacba2ace75af6c9c400c022bc80a93361f16d6b1e5d9b511631
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7A6088F2_2857_4496_9125_BCEA0EA68271"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Who cares that we’re not rich anymore?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫We’ll figure things out in no time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫平民になったからってなによ。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ネリーとお兄さまなら、⟪k:4⟫すぐに色んなことを覚え"
"て――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_65533E70_3D7C_4305_92E2_C898165BAD9F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80a7228fb25882df7ce7aff61d76745fc4886767f44dd404b65088441c180d79
#. default-sha256: 185b69432d5b43b151de84f80256f03924ed4d9074bad22fb970fbda680b25f6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_65533E70_3D7C_4305_92E2_C898165BAD9F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And then we’ll have even more fun than we did back there!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫今までより楽しく生活できるようになるわ！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_89CC1705_38AE_40B2_BCEF_1A28D235D33D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a609d3e41e1589280e41da6208cc6f01d0b8a8d162c66af7beca2c67bd2864f
#. default-sha256: 291d6690953f498339c2a21174481e4ac304b382ea34a105c1ab656396f88a71
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_89CC1705_38AE_40B2_BCEF_1A28D235D33D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You’ve got yourself an adorable little princess!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫What more could you possibly "
"need?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ネリーがお兄さまの、⟪k:2⟫うんとかわいいお姫さまをしてあげるわ！⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫それで十分で"
"しょ？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_8871344A_3F24_4690_8C8C_8A34F4D9E84D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 556d283cb43b4780db80d5082db5ff907741017984dfd052fce614f89d2dd816
#. default-sha256: 6eda082000ee3825e7dba4433f3390ad52c0a70c12bcec592d721d3fd4b95fdb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8871344A_3F24_4690_8C8C_8A34F4D9E84D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Cheer up!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ねっ、⟪k:2⟫だからお兄さま。⟪k:3⟫元気だして？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_3E139956_A055_4D47_B55D_3FAAA6856A23
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78f1c26f5d13867f3117b50a895b3e66be308172133750297b7e3de2e7131ddf
#. default-sha256: d704186c622660076542133f7bb880e5d7128aabf798adec872e1026adb04e4f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3E139956_A055_4D47_B55D_3FAAA6856A23"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ohoho. Did you think for a second I wouldn’t?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’m your princess, dearest Mell!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……ふふふん、⟪k:2⟫ネリーがお兄さまの傍にいるのは当然よ？⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫だってネリーは、⟪k:5⟫お"
"兄さまのお姫さまなんですもの！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_3ED2A53C_3AFD_4A2F_89B6_974A96B940D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 013abd8a52a18418efab9f24cee38730ec7f0d25f15e7c761ffe2ccf3ce487b9
#. default-sha256: 3ae18437f6bafafc6d147e69021a5d90d49f4fda07506c42a651170e7451de3e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3ED2A53C_3AFD_4A2F_89B6_974A96B940D5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And princesses belong with their princes."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫お姫さまは、⟪k:2⟫王子さまの傍にいるべきだわ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_76276090_6E2F_4AF5_81BB_20FBB6F318B9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4061e935ca47fc7562dd12ec1dffd8bedfe53ad0ab10cd129a7511964badab9
#. default-sha256: 7ed6cee4cccf0e939b8afe1c69956b80c8613a7bd5c2a01b859604ae13f26fc5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_76276090_6E2F_4AF5_81BB_20FBB6F318B9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but Nellie calling me her prince gave me the illusion of being worth something."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ネリーがそう言ってくれたら、⟪k:1⟫自分に価値があるように錯覚出来たんだ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_3F2F6511_96BF_4686_99A5_2288F805FB64
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc9d713994cb6f84f8e25f4b756e047dacc8800ea2784f3dc9c279f9d91749e5
#. default-sha256: c5360ffa621e22358704c934e9873410966f2cda8771681d87202ca10a18bef6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3F2F6511_96BF_4686_99A5_2288F805FB64"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It made me feel like I could keep on being that richly blessed young man, even this far away "
"from home."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫昔のような、⟪k:1⟫何にでも恵まれていた自分のままでいられるような……そんな気がした。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_CC8CE97C_57A4_4844_94E7_B1E25F7B1C5E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 529c6b26d0b5b70d10ecbfb7db68c50a9855821e5beeb6bcc032686d1860945d
#. default-sha256: 789668747fc5ea0e70d3a71ba752eed7fc4c6f2a98d7fdd4f443180c2b29dfc2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CC8CE97C_57A4_4844_94E7_B1E25F7B1C5E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but to be quite honest, I couldn’t gather the motivation to do much of anything."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫正直言って……、⟪k:1⟫何も、⟪k:2⟫やる気が起きなかったんだ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_63C6DAC9_1B4B_48E4_B46D_DCEA67D4D6F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7e2f4758ac74a92beb11b83ae252d2edd095964aeb4bd8b275aeb7e114dbfad5
#. default-sha256: 7f4efdd38a6e4e74d661bdbcd95e86009265a383e5c4cb2f68733bebe596797c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_63C6DAC9_1B4B_48E4_B46D_DCEA67D4D6F3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It had knocked me on my backside,⟪k:1⟫and I didn’t have the strength to get back up."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ショックが大きすぎて……、⟪k:1⟫立ち上がれなかったんだよ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_ADDC0075_5107_434C_B85B_C7D0503F1A53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 689f594cf3d89051e1d5384a9f3dae0a1f08daf8bb8f73e876935e831fa2a524
#. default-sha256: fe679d7977eca478e2a07c827317d33d785192f39a2fc193a7f6eb97c141007a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_ADDC0075_5107_434C_B85B_C7D0503F1A53"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t tell Nellie that, of course, so this is what I said instead:"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫でも、⟪k:1⟫もちろんそんなことを、⟪k:2⟫ネリーに言えるわけがなかったから……。⟪k:3⟫僕はね、⟪k:4⟫"
"こういうことにしておいたんだ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_C7BB2910_3DBF_482D_A538_4565683DF042
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b22d75cc0c7626d40f119848cfe1239a88cf63a7964a1296da5db8f4235e8e03
